Render a page
renderPage(page <p>Text</p>)
stdout : <p>Text</p> : Xml

Unhandled operation in a page
renderPage(page <p>{do Fail}</p>)
stderr : @..*
args : --enable-handlers
exit : 1

Handle an operation and render the resulting page
renderPage(handle({do Fail}) { case <Fail> -> page <p>Caught</p> case _ -> page <p>Success</p> })
stdout : <p>Caught</p> : Xml
args : --enable-handlers
